# Production Docker build context exclusions for the backend service.
#
# The Dockerfile uses `COPY . .` after `pip install -r requirements.txt`, so
# anything in the build context that's not explicitly excluded here will ship
# into the production image and may end up on disk inside the running ECS
# container. This file closes the leak surface flagged as P0 in the
# 2026-05-18 evaluation (DK-01).
#
# Categories of exclusion:
#   1. Secrets / credentials      (.env*, *.pem, *.key)
#   2. Local databases            (*.db, *.sqlite, *.db-shm, *.db-wal)
#   3. Local logs / coverage      (*.log, .coverage*, htmlcov/, .pytest_cache/)
#   4. Local virtualenvs          (venv/, venv_*/, .venv/, lib/)
#   5. Test artifacts             (tests/, test-results/)
#   6. Editor / OS / VCS          (.git/, .vscode/, .idea/, .DS_Store)
#   7. Cached bytecode            (__pycache__/, *.pyc, *.pyo, *.pyd)
#   8. Documentation              (*.md - shipped via the docs site, not the API image)
#   9. Misc artifacts             (typo pip filenames, captured HTTP responses)

# --- 1. Secrets / credentials ---
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12

# --- 2. Local databases ---
*.db
*.sqlite
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# --- 3. Local logs / coverage ---
*.log
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# --- 4. Local virtualenvs ---
venv/
venv_*/
.venv/
env/
ENV/
lib/

# --- 5. Test artifacts ---
tests/
test-results/

# --- 6. Editor / OS / VCS ---
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github/
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo

# --- 7. Cached bytecode ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
*.so

# --- 8. Documentation ---
*.md
docs/

# --- 9. Misc local-dev artifacts surfaced by 2026-05-18 audit ---
=*
# (e.g. `=3.0.0` left over from a botched `pip install foo>=3.0.0`)
completion-trends*
# (captured HTTP response from a debugging session)
uploads/
# (runtime-only directory, recreated by start.sh at container start)
data/
# (CSV seed data is loaded by a separate flow, not baked into the image)

# --- Build artifacts ---
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
